        <div class="card mb-20" id="about-overview">
          <div class="card-header"><h3>System Overview</h3></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px;">The Predictive Fraud Intelligence System (PFIS) is an AI-powered fraud prevention platform commissioned by the Financial Intelligence Centre. It is designed to monitor and evaluate financial transactions in real time across banking, mobile money, and digital payment infrastructure.</p>
            <p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px;">Unlike conventional fraud systems that respond reactively after fraudulent activity has occurred, PFIS employs a proactive, predictive approach. By continuously learning the behavioural patterns of each user, PFIS can identify subtle deviations that may signal manipulation or unauthorised access — often before the customer even realises they are being targeted.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

