          <div class="card-header"><h3>Legal &amp; Regulatory Framework</h3></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:12px;">PFIS operates within the following legislative and regulatory instruments:</p>
            <ul style="font-size:14px;line-height:2;padding-left:20px;color:var(--gov-text);">
              <li>Anti-Money Laundering Act, 2020 (Act 1044)</li>
              <li>Payment Systems and Services Act, 2019 (Act 987)</li>
              <li>Electronic Transactions Act, 2008 (Act 772)</li>
              <li>Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843)</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="alert-strip info mt-16">All data collected by PFIS is processed in accordance with Ghana's Data Protection Act. User data is encrypted, access-controlled, and subject to the data retention policies of the Financial Intelligence Centre.</div>
          </div>
